Chalo ek simple program dekhte hain jo 1 se 5 tak numbers print kare. Yeh `for` loop ka istemal karke kiya gaya hai:

```cpp
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;

int main() {
    // For loop example
    for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) {
        cout << i << " ";
    }
    return 0;
}
```

Is program ka output yeh hoga:
`1 2 3 4 5`

Yeh dekhne mein chhota lagta hai, lekin isse pata chalta hai ke kaise ek loop ka istemal karke repetitive task ko automate kiya ja sakta hai.
